    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010020,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "でも、アイドルは食べすぎないように\r\n気を付けた方がいいよね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、ご飯が美味しいのはいいことだし\r\n我慢しなくたっていいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010030,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "えーっ──！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010040,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "我慢しなくていい、って──\r\nそれであたしが太っちゃったらどうするの？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010050,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "……プロデューサー、責任取ってくれる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし。その時は責任を取って、しっかり\r\n減量用のトレーニングメニューを考えるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010060,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "それ絶対大変なやつ──！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010070,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "はぁ……寮のみんなに\r\n食事の管理ってどうしてるか聞いてみようかな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！\r\nだけど、羽那が寮生活も楽しめてるみたいでよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "地元からひとりで出てきて──\r\n心細いこともあるんじゃないかって思ってたからさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010080,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "……そうだね、寮はいつも賑やかだから\r\n心細いって思ったことはないなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010100,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "──そうだ\r\nプロデューサーも今度寮のご飯、食べに来ない？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102700211/1027002010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、大丈夫だよ\r\n寮のみんなに迷惑がかかっちゃうかもしれないしさ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1027002010110,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "えーっ、そうかな？\r\n遠慮しなくていいのにーっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
